---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import StructuredData from '../components/StructuredData.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Services | Start & Scale"
	description="Revenue strategy, brand and communications, operations, fundraising prep, and AI advisory. Built from 15+ years inside high-growth, founder-led companies."
	canonical="/services"
>
	<StructuredData type="organization" />

	<!-- Hero -->
			<section class="bg-dark pt-32 pb-16 sm:pt-40 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-28">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<h1 class="font-display text-white text-h1 lg:text-[3.75rem] lg:leading-[1.05] max-w-4xl">
						Five ways we work with founders.
					</h1>
					<p class="text-body-lg text-body-light mt-6 max-w-2xl">
						Each one built from operating experience inside companies at every stage from stealth to IPO. In rooms where the playbook didn't exist yet.
					</p>
					<p class="text-body-lg text-body-light mt-4 max-w-2xl">
						Every engagement is scoped to your stage.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Revenue & GTM -->
			<section id="revenue-gtm" class="bg-background py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<div class="max-w-3xl">
						<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">01</p>
						<h2 class="font-display text-headline text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Revenue & GTM</h2>
						<p class="text-body-lg text-body mt-6">
							Your product has traction but sales can't keep pace. Pipeline is inconsistent, reps are missing quota, and pricing was set eighteen months ago on a hunch.
						</p>
						<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4 mt-10">What we do</h3>
						<p class="text-body text-body mt-3">
							We design sales processes, build pipeline architecture, fix pricing, and structure your channel strategy. If you need to hire reps, we help you find the right ones and coach them through ramp.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded mt-8">
							<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Our track record</p>
							<p class="text-body text-body">
								Our team built the CloudKitchens Northeast revenue org from zero: 42 people, 9 markets, 8 months, 120%+ of plan. At WeWork, we scaled regional ARR from $20M to $120M in 24 months across 21 locations.
							</p>
						</div>
						<a href="https://calendly.com/chris-ssgrowthadvisors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-hover text-btn mt-8 inline-block hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer">
							Talk about your revenue engine &rarr;
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Divider -->
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><hr class="border-border" /></div>

			<!-- Brand & Communications -->
			<section id="brand-communications" class="bg-background py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<div class="max-w-3xl">
						<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">02</p>
						<h2 class="font-display text-headline text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Brand & Communications</h2>
						<p class="text-body-lg text-body mt-6">
							Your work is better than your story. The brand fits who you were three years ago, your website and pitch say different things, and customers, donors, and partners can't repeat what you do.
						</p>
						<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4 mt-10">What we do</h3>
						<p class="text-body text-body mt-3">
							We sharpen your positioning, write the core messaging, and lead brand refreshes from audit to launch, with design partners on visual identity. Then we plan communications for each audience and build the website that carries the story. No handoff to an agency.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded mt-8">
							<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Our track record</p>
							<p class="text-body text-body">
								For a local nonprofit, we rebuilt the website around its refreshed brand and wrote its search, donor, and volunteer communications strategies. For an off-grid education startup, we defined positioning and brand voice from zero, then built the content engine behind them.
							</p>
						</div>
						<a href="https://calendly.com/chris-ssgrowthadvisors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-hover text-btn mt-8 inline-block hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer">
							Talk about your brand &rarr;
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Divider -->
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><hr class="border-border" /></div>

			<!-- Operations & Systems -->
			<section id="operations-systems" class="bg-background py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<div class="max-w-3xl">
						<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">03</p>
						<h2 class="font-display text-headline text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Operations & Systems</h2>
						<p class="text-body-lg text-body mt-6">
							Your team doubled but your processes didn't. The CRM is half-populated, marketing tools don't talk to each other, and pulling a report takes half a day.
						</p>
						<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4 mt-10">What we do</h3>
						<p class="text-body text-body mt-3">
							We audit your tech stack and cut the tools you're paying for but not using. Then we implement and configure CRM (Salesforce, HubSpot), set up marketing automation, design repeatable processes, and build the data infrastructure that lets you see what's happening. We do the configuration ourselves.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded mt-8">
							<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Our track record</p>
							<p class="text-body text-body">
								We led the Salesforce NPSP rollout for a national nonprofit operating across 29 states, then integrated it with Salesforce Marketing Cloud, GA4, and Givebutter for end-to-end donor tracking. For a trust administration firm, we mapped the full administration workflow and built the platform to automate it.
							</p>
						</div>
						<a href="https://calendly.com/chris-ssgrowthadvisors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-hover text-btn mt-8 inline-block hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer">
							Talk about your ops &rarr;
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Divider -->
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><hr class="border-border" /></div>

			<!-- Fundraising & Investor Readiness -->
			<section id="fundraising" class="bg-background py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<div class="max-w-3xl">
						<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">04</p>
						<h2 class="font-display text-headline text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Fundraising & Investor Readiness</h2>
						<p class="text-body-lg text-body mt-6">
							You need to raise but your story doesn't land. Metrics are in five different spreadsheets, your deck gets polite nods but no term sheets, and you're guessing at what investors want to see.
						</p>
						<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4 mt-10">What we do</h3>
						<p class="text-body text-body mt-3">
							We develop your deck, frame your narrative around what investors actually evaluate, package your metrics clearly, and build your outreach strategy. The work is informed by direct experience inside companies preparing to raise.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded mt-8">
							<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Our track record</p>
							<p class="text-body text-body">
								Our team has operated inside companies at every funding stage. Stealth launch at Allwhere (built GTM, generated 50% of revenue in 6 months). Rapid scale at WeWork through the IPO run. And the restructuring that followed.
							</p>
						</div>
						<a href="https://calendly.com/chris-ssgrowthadvisors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-hover text-btn mt-8 inline-block hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer">
							Talk about your raise &rarr;
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Divider -->
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><hr class="border-border" /></div>

			<!-- AI & Technology -->
			<section id="ai-technology" class="bg-background py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
					<div class="max-w-3xl">
						<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">05</p>
						<h2 class="font-display text-headline text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">AI & Technology</h2>
						<p class="text-body-lg text-body mt-6">
							You keep hearing you need AI. You've tried a few tools and nothing stuck, your data is too sensitive to paste into a chatbot, and no one on the team owns the problem.
						</p>
						<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4 mt-10">What we do</h3>
						<p class="text-body text-body mt-3">
							We map your workflows and prove the highest-value use case with a working pilot. Then we build it inside your own environment, so sensitive data never leaves it, and train your team to run it. When we recommend something, we can ship it.
						</p>
						<div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded mt-8">
							<p class="text-small text-accent-hover uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Our track record</p>
							<p class="text-body text-body">
								We built a trust administration platform from zero, including AI that reads incoming documents and pulls out the data. It's production-ready, with 19 Edge Functions behind it. We also rolled out Claude Enterprise across a national nonprofit's team.
							</p>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-display text-headline text-h4 mt-10">How an engagement runs</h3>
						<ol role="list" class="mt-4 space-y-4">
							<li class="flex gap-4">
								<span class="font-display text-accent-hover font-semibold shrink-0 w-5" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
								<p class="text-body text-body"><strong class="text-headline font-semibold">Pilot, <span class="whitespace-nowrap">2–4 weeks</span>.</strong> Map the process, pick the highest-value use case, and prove it with a working pilot in your environment.</p>
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-4">
								<span class="font-display text-accent-hover font-semibold shrink-0 w-5" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
								<p class="text-body text-body"><strong class="text-headline font-semibold">Build and hand off.</strong> Build the full workflow, connect it to your systems, document it, and train your team to own it.</p>
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-4">
								<span class="font-display text-accent-hover font-semibold shrink-0 w-5" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
								<p class="text-body text-body"><strong class="text-headline font-semibold">Advise.</strong> Monthly time to review what's working, scope the next use case, and keep you current as the tools change.</p>
							</li>
						</ol>
						<a href="https://calendly.com/chris-ssgrowthadvisors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-hover text-btn mt-8 inline-block hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer">
							Talk about AI for your business &rarr;
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CTA Block -->
			<section class="bg-dark py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center">
					<h2 class="font-display text-white text-h2 lg:text-[3rem] lg:leading-[1.1]">Not sure which applies?</h2>
					<p class="text-body-lg text-body-light mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto">Most clients need a combination. Start with a 30-minute call and we'll figure out where the biggest bottleneck is.</p>
					<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 items-center">
						<a href="https://calendly.com/chris-ssgrowthadvisors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-accent-hover text-white text-btn px-7 py-3.5 rounded hover:brightness-90 transition duration-150 cursor-pointer inline-block">
							Book a Call
						</a>
						<a href="/contact" class="text-body-light text-btn hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer inline-block py-3.5">
							Or send a message &rarr;
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
</BaseLayout>
